# agentskills.io bundle loader sample

This fixture is a minimal `.mda` source designed to be loaded by an
agentskills.io runtime. The `metadata.agentskills` block declares the
runtime version constraint and the loader options the runtime should
apply when calling `mda-config`.

On a successful load, the runtime can lift the front-matter directly
into its skill manifest without further parsing — `mda-config` has
already validated the schema and run the integrity check.
